        "code": {
          "text": "Localized dry rough patch, right dorsal forearm; likely benign lesion. Differential includes actinic keratosis, mild dermatitis/eczema, and less likely seborrheic keratosis; early non-melanoma skin cancer considered less likely based on history only."
        }
      }
    },
